OSC 8 hyperlink and related-feature fixture
Reference baseline: https://wiki.mudlet.org/w/Manual:Supported_Protocols
Serve: cargo run --release -p smudgy_bench --example log_server -- bench/logs/osc8-features.log
Then connect a Smudgy profile to 127.0.0.1:5000.

This file contains real ESC ] 8 sequences (mostly ST-terminated; one BEL case).
Expected result labels describe Smudgy's current behavior. Hover links to inspect
tooltips and disclosed targets; left-click only trusted test targets; right-click
where a menu is expected. Never turn a KNOWN GAP into an advertised capability.

Advertised through NEW-ENVIRON:
  OSC_HYPERLINKS, OSC_HYPERLINKS_COMPACT, OSC_HYPERLINKS_DISABLED,
  OSC_HYPERLINKS_MENU, OSC_HYPERLINKS_PROMPT, OSC_HYPERLINKS_SEND,
  OSC_HYPERLINKS_TOOLTIP.
Not advertised:
  OSC_HYPERLINKS_PRESETS, OSC_HYPERLINKS_SELECTION, OSC_HYPERLINKS_SPOILER,
  OSC_HYPERLINKS_STYLE_BASIC, OSC_HYPERLINKS_STYLE_STATES,
  OSC_HYPERLINKS_VISIBILITY.

Legend:
  SUPPORTED  feature should work as described
  PARTIAL    safe base link works; named extension metadata is ignored
  REJECTED   no link styling, tooltip, click action, or menu
  KNOWN GAP  deliberate QA record for behavior not yet claimed

