==================== SCRIPT-CREATED COMPANION QA ====================
These examples are source text, not executable OSC sequences. Run them in a script
or adapt them to line.replace(...) while viewing this fixture:

  line.replace('foo bar', link('https://www.google.com', {
    tooltip: async () => 'hello',
  })`foo bar`);
  line.replace('status', link(null, { tooltip: 'Passive help' })`status`);
  line.replace('item', link(null, {
    tooltip: [
      '\x1b[38;2;255;196;64mFlaming Sword\x1b[0m',
      '\x1b[38;2;120;215;255mDamage:\x1b[0m 12-18',
      '\x1b[38;2;120;215;255mSpeed:\x1b[0m Fast',
      '\x1b[38;2;112;230;154mDamage type: Fire\x1b[0m',
    ].join('\n'),
  })`item`);
  line.replace('actions', link(null, {
    menu: [{ label: 'Look', action: 'look' }],
  })`actions`); // left or right click opens the menu
  line.replace('right only', link(null, {
    enabled: false,
    menu: [{ label: 'Look', action: 'look' }],
  })`right only`); // left click is inert; right click opens the menu

End of OSC 8 feature fixture.
